[GitHub's runner reference](https://docs.github.com/en/actions/reference/runners/github-hosted-runners)
lists 14 GB storage for standard private-repository Ubuntu runners. Its
[larger-runner documentation](https://docs.github.com/en/actions/concepts/runners/larger-runners)
limits larger Linux runners to organizations/enterprises on eligible plans.
Changing only the existing workflow label is therefore not a verified solution
for this personal repository. Repository visibility or ownership must not be
changed as a capacity workaround.

